WEBVTT

1
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:28,660
why cry

2
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:31,660
No one coaxed me when I was a child

3
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:34,110
After their parents got married,

4
00:00:34,110 --> 00:00:37,300
Thought I would hate my younger siblings

5
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:38,300
Don't let me get close

6
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:41,300
Actually I don't hate them

7
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:43,560
If my sister sticks to me like this

8
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:45,560
This is probably what it looks like

9
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:47,070
Stop crying

10
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:50,070
My parents won't let me cause you any trouble

11
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:52,070
Sister Xiao Xiao

12
00:00:52,070 --> 00:00:54,070
Did I cause you any trouble?

13
00:00:54,070 --> 00:00:55,070
you didn't cause me any trouble

14
00:00:55,070 --> 00:00:57,070
But when in danger

15
00:00:57,070 --> 00:00:59,070
You have to cooperate with everyone's actions

16
00:00:59,070 --> 00:01:08,260
Your parents are here for you
